<title>GERMANY: Deutsche mulling French bank acquisition.</title>
<headline>Deutsche mulling French bank acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG chairman Rolf Breuer told the interim results news briefing on Wednesday it was considering an acquisition in the French banking sector.</p>
<p>Breuer, who gave no further details, said the bank was not however planning any purchases either in Germany or the U.S.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
